  {
    "heading": "PRINTABLE WORKSHEETS   /   03",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "style": "Heading 1",
        "text": "Worked sinus symptom summary"
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "style": "Subtitle",
        "text": "Fictional example   /   7 to 20 September"
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "style": "Worksheet prompt",
        "text": "Why I booked"
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "style": "Worksheet fill",
        "text": "I’d like help understanding the recent increase in morning blockage."
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "style": "Worksheet prompt",
        "text": "Dates and coverage"
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "style": "Worksheet fill",
        "text": "7–20 September. I recorded 11 of 14 mornings."
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "style": "Worksheet prompt",
        "text": "Main pattern"
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "style": "Worksheet fill",
        "text": "Blockage was worse than my usual on 2 of 5 recorded mornings in week one and 4 of 6 in week two. Three week-two entries mentioned the left side felt more blocked. I’m unsure what happened on the three missed mornings."
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "style": "Worksheet prompt",
        "text": "Daily impact"
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "style": "Worksheet fill",
        "text": "I woke overnight on 10 September and felt tired at work the next day."
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "style": "Worksheet prompt",
        "text": "What I used"
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "style": "Worksheet fill",
        "text": "I recorded saline rinses on 9 and 16 September. I felt clearer after the first. I didn’t record a follow-up after the second."
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "style": "Worksheet prompt",
        "text": "My questions"
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "style": "Worksheet fill",
        "text": "What would you check to understand why it’s often worse on the left? What should I keep recording before we review it?"
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "style": "Worksheet prompt",
        "text": "Next step and who will arrange it"
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "style": "Worksheet fill",
        "text": "Space to fill during the appointment."
      }
    ]
  },
